family":"Roboto","typography_font_size":{"unit":"px","size":28,"sizes":[]},"typography_font_weight":"300","title_color":"#598199","_margin":{"unit":"%","top":"-2","right":"0","bottom":"0","left":"0","isLinked":false},"_padding":{"unit":"px","top":"0","right":"0","bottom":"0","left":"0","isLinked":true},"__dynamic__":{"title":"[elementor-tag id=\"36988ea\" name=\"page-title\" settings=\"%7B%7D\"]"},"_element_width":"initial","_element_custom_width":{"unit":"%","size":100,"sizes":[]},"_margin_tablet":{"unit":"%","top":"","right":"","bottom":"","left":"","isLinked":true},"_margin_mobile":{"unit":"%","top":"","right":"","bottom":"","left":"","isLinked":true},"align":"center","typography_font_size_mobile":{"unit":"px","size":18,"sizes":[]},"eael_vto_writing_gradient_color_repeater":[{"eael_vto_writing_gradient_color":"#7C62FF","eael_vto_writing_gradient_color_location":{"unit":"%","size":50,"sizes":[]},"_id":"3b4915d"},{"eael_vto_writing_gradient_color":"#FF6464","eael_vto_writing_gradient_color_location":{"unit":"%","size":90,"sizes":[]},"_id":"b7c2ef6"}]},"elements":[],"isInner":false,"widgetType":"heading","elType":"widget"}],"isInner":true,"elType":"container"},{"id":"4b977139","settings":{"editor":"<p>En ProActivo Finance trabajamos con inversores, promotores y empresas que buscan <a href=\"https:\/\/proactivofinance.com\/financiacion-con-capital-privado-en-marbella\/\"><strong>financiaci\u00f3n \u00e1gil<\/strong><\/a> para ejecutar operaciones inmobiliarias en <strong>Marbella y la Costa del Sol<\/strong> sin depender de los tiempos de la banca tradicional.<\/p><p>Marbella es uno de los mercados inmobiliarios m\u00e1s competitivos de Espa\u00f1a. Las oportunidades de <strong>compra, reforma, promoci\u00f3n o reposicionamiento de activos<\/strong> suelen requerir decisiones r\u00e1pidas, capital disponible y una estructura financiera flexible.<\/p><p>Por eso ofrecemos <strong>pr\u00e9stamos para inversi\u00f3n inmobiliaria en Marbella<\/strong>: soluciones de <strong>capital privado con garant\u00eda hipotecaria<\/strong>, pensadas para quienes necesitan actuar con velocidad y seguridad.<\/p>","paragraph_spacing":{"unit":"px","size":36,"sizes":[]},"text_color":"#FFF6F6","link_color":"#FFF6F6","_margin":{"unit":"px","top":"0","right":"0","bottom":"0","left":"0","isLinked":false},"_padding":{"unit":"px","top":"20","right":"0","bottom":"0","left":"0","isLinked":false},"__globals__":{"link_color":"","link_hover_color":"globals\/colors?id=secondary"},"eael_vto_writing_gradient_color_repeater":[{"eael_vto_writing_gradient_color":"#7C62FF","eael_vto_writing_gradient_color_location":{"unit":"%","size":50,"sizes":[]},"_id":"1d74bff"},{"eael_vto_writing_gradient_color":"#FF6464","eael_vto_writing_gradient_color_location":{"unit":"%","size":90,"sizes":[]},"_id":"173b67a"}]},"elements":[],"isInner":false,"widgetType":"text-editor","elType":"widget"},{"id":"53dd03bf","settings":{"content_width":"full","margin":{"unit":"px","top":"0","right":"0","bottom":"0","left":"0","isLinked":true},"padding":{"unit":"px","top":"0","right":"0","bottom":"0","left":"0","isLinked":true}},"elements":[{"id":"6a2debe7","settings":{"title":"Marbella: un mercado de alto valor y alta competencia","align":"center","typography_typography":"custom","title_color":"#FFFFFF","eael_vto_writing_gradient_color_repeater":[{"eael_vto_writing_gradient_color":"#7C62FF","eael_vto_writing_gradient_color_location":{"unit":"%","size":50,"sizes":[]},"_id":"4f0ce6f"},{"eael_vto_writing_gradient_color":"#FF6464","eael_vto_writing_gradient_color_location":{"unit":"%","size":90,"sizes":[]},"_id":"042c2db"}]},"elements":[],"isInner":false,"widgetType":"heading","elType":"widget"},{"id":"3f3ea844","settings":{"editor":"<p>El mercado inmobiliario de Marbella combina demanda internacional, escasez de activos prime y una fuerte presi\u00f3n en zonas como Nueva Andaluc\u00eda, Puerto Ban\u00fas, Sierra Blanca, Golden Mile, San Pedro de Alc\u00e1ntara o Benahav\u00eds.<\/p><p>En este contexto, esperar semanas o meses a una aprobaci\u00f3n bancaria puede significar perder una operaci\u00f3n rentable. Muchos inversores necesitan cerrar arras, comprar un inmueble con descuento, iniciar una reforma o desbloquear una carga antes de que la oportunidad desaparezca.<\/p><p>La financiaci\u00f3n privada permite responder a ese ritmo. Analizamos la operaci\u00f3n desde la l\u00f3gica del activo y del proyecto, no desde un modelo bancario r\u00edgido que muchas veces no entiende la urgencia del mercado.<\/p>","paragraph_spacing":{"unit":"px","size":36,"sizes":[]},"text_color":"#FFF6F6","link_color":"#FFF6F6","_margin":{"unit":"px","top":"0","right":"0","bottom":"0","left":"0","isLinked":false},"_padding":{"unit":"px","top":"20","right":"0","bottom":"0","left":"0","isLinked":false},"__globals__":{"link_color":"","link_hover_color":"globals\/colors?id=secondary"},"eael_vto_writing_gradient_color_repeater":[{"eael_vto_writing_gradient_color":"#7C62FF","eael_vto_writing_gradient_color_location":{"unit":"%","size":50,"sizes":[]},"_id":"522d083"},{"eael_vto_writing_gradient_color":"#FF6464","eael_vto_writing_gradient_color_location":{"unit":"%","size":90,"sizes":[]},"_id":"12a8424"}]},"elements":[],"isInner":false,"widgetType":"text-editor","elType":"widget"}],"isInner":true,"elType":"container"},{"id":"252883e0","settings":{"content_width":"full","margin":{"unit":"px","top":"0","right":"0","bottom":"0","left":"0","isLinked":true},"padding":{"unit":"px","top":"0","right":"0","bottom":"0","left":"0","isLinked":true}},"elements":[{"id":"69bfed40","settings":{"title":"\u00bfQu\u00e9 operaciones financiamos en Marbella?","align":"center","typography_typography":"custom","title_color":"#FFFFFF","_margin":{"unit":"px","top":"20","right":"0","bottom":"020","left":"0","isLinked":false},"eael_vto_writing_gradient_color_repeater":[{"eael_vto_writing_gradient_color":"#7C62FF","eael_vto_writing_gradient_color_location":{"unit":"%","size":50,"sizes":[]},"_id":"600fb51"},{"eael_vto_