ef=\"https:\/\/proactivofinance.com\/prestamo-puente-con-capital-privado-en-marbella\"><strong>Financiaci\u00f3n puente<\/strong><\/a> mientras se vende otro activo inmobiliario.<\/li><li>Promociones peque\u00f1as o proyectos de rehabilitaci\u00f3n con salida comercial clara.<\/li><\/ul>","paragraph_spacing":{"unit":"px","size":36,"sizes":[]},"text_color":"#FFF6F6","link_color":"#FFF6F6","_margin":{"unit":"px","top":"0","right":"0","bottom":"0","left":"0","isLinked":false},"_padding":{"unit":"px","top":"0","right":"0","bottom":"0","left":"0","isLinked":false},"__globals__":{"link_color":"","link_hover_color":"globals\/colors?id=secondary"},"align":"left","eael_vto_writing_gradient_color_repeater":[{"eael_vto_writing_gradient_color":"#7C62FF","eael_vto_writing_gradient_color_location":{"unit":"%","size":50,"sizes":[]},"_id":"3632e34"},{"eael_vto_writing_gradient_color":"#FF6464","eael_vto_writing_gradient_color_location":{"unit":"%","size":90,"sizes":[]},"_id":"2af8103"}]},"elements":[],"isInner":false,"widgetType":"text-editor","elType":"widget"},{"id":"148cc8f9","settings":{"editor":"<p>En todos los casos, la clave es contar con un inmueble que pueda respaldar la operaci\u00f3n y una estrategia de devoluci\u00f3n coherente.<\/p>","paragraph_spacing":{"unit":"px","size":36,"sizes":[]},"text_color":"#FFF6F6","link_color":"#FFF6F6","_margin":{"unit":"px","top":"0","right":"0","bottom":"0","left":"0","isLinked":false},"_padding":{"unit":"px","top":"20","right":"0","bottom":"0","left":"0","isLinked":false},"__globals__":{"link_color":"","link_hover_color":"globals\/colors?id=secondary"},"align":"left","eael_vto_writing_gradient_color_repeater":[{"eael_vto_writing_gradient_color":"#7C62FF","eael_vto_writing_gradient_color_location":{"unit":"%","size":50,"sizes":[]},"_id":"0498758"},{"eael_vto_writing_gradient_color":"#FF6464","eael_vto_writing_gradient_color_location":{"unit":"%","size":90,"sizes":[]},"_id":"0b566f2"}]},"elements":[],"isInner":false,"widgetType":"text-editor","elType":"widget"},{"id":"537795ab","settings":{"content_width":"full","margin":{"unit":"px","top":"0","right":"0","bottom":"0","left":"0","isLinked":true},"padding":{"unit":"px","top":"40","right":"0","bottom":"0","left":"0","isLinked":false}},"elements":[{"id":"35085847","settings":{"title":"\u00bfPor qu\u00e9 elegir capital privado para invertir en Marbella?","align":"center","typography_typography":"custom","title_color":"#FFFFFF","_margin":{"unit":"px","top":"20","right":"0","bottom":"020","left":"0","isLinked":false},"eael_vto_writing_gradient_color_repeater":[{"eael_vto_writing_gradient_color":"#7C62FF","eael_vto_writing_gradient_color_location":{"unit":"%","size":50,"sizes":[]},"_id":"cb256b0"},{"eael_vto_writing_gradient_color":"#FF6464","eael_vto_writing_gradient_color_location":{"unit":"%","size":90,"sizes":[]},"_id":"92025c9"}]},"elements":[],"isInner":false,"widgetType":"heading","elType":"widget"},{"id":"4b2a1ce4","settings":{"editor":"<p>La banca tradicional suele trabajar con plazos, documentaci\u00f3n y criterios que no siempre encajan con una inversi\u00f3n inmobiliaria urgente. En Marbella, donde una oportunidad puede cerrarse en cuesti\u00f3n de d\u00edas, esa lentitud puede ser la diferencia entre ganar o quedarse fuera.<\/p><p>Con capital privado, el an\u00e1lisis se centra en el valor del activo, la viabilidad de la operaci\u00f3n y la capacidad de estructurar una salida razonable. Esto permite financiar escenarios que el banco rechazar\u00eda por timing, incidencias previas o falta de encaje documental.<\/p><p>Las ventajas principales son:<\/p>","paragraph_spacing":{"unit":"px","size":36,"sizes":[]},"text_color":"#FFF6F6","link_color":"#FFF6F6","_margin":{"unit":"px","top":"0","right":"0","bottom":"0","left":"0","isLinked":false},"_padding":{"unit":"px","top":"20","right":"0","bottom":"0","left":"0","isLinked":false},"__globals__":{"link_color":"","link_hover_color":"globals\/colors?id=secondary"},"align":"left","eael_vto_writing_gradie